COPILOT_COMMENTS
{"body":"`COPILOT_CLI_PATH` is already the CLI executable path in this SDK (`java/pom.xml:65,336` sets it to `npm-loader.js`, and `CopilotClientOptions` documents the same meaning). Returning it as `runtime.node` will hand JNA a JavaScript/CLI entry point, and the early return also makes the later sibling lookup unreachable. Use a distinct explicit runtime override, or derive the sibling `runtime.node` from the actual bundled CLI path.","id":3679550014,"in_reply_to_id":null,"line":68,"path":"java/src/main/java/com/github/copilot/ffi/NativeRuntimeLoader.java","user":"Copilot"}
{"body":"All extraction tests call this test-only reimplementation rather than `NativeRuntimeLoader.extractToCache`, `extractToTemp`, or `atomicPublish`. Consequently the production atomic move, force, race handling, and cleanup can regress while these tests remain green. Expose an injectable/package-private production entry point and have the tests exercise it directly.","id":3679550047,"in_reply_to_id":null,"line":317,"path":"java/src/test/java/com/github/copilot/ffi/NativeRuntimeLoaderTest.java","user":"Copilot"}

